Diagonal (X-centre) orbit certificate, concise form (2026-11-06).  Per orbit 10 + 16 + 18 = 44 moves.

Stages (same as cert/diag/centres-first, which holds a line for every class):
  none..D          10,626 positions, worst 10; kept 259 of     1,381 lines
  D..U              4,845 positions, worst 16; kept 211 of       635 lines
  UD..LFRB     63,063,000 positions, worst 18; kept 163 of 3,950,059 lines

Files: stages/STAGE/wNN.txt, the kept solving sequences (same file names as the full form; a subset of its lines).
Rule: the actions of a stage are its face turns plus every kept line of at most 6 moves, under the 48 cube
symmetries and inversion, each costing its move count, restricted to those that keep the stage's placed colours
home.  A Dijkstra search over the stage positions, from the goal and from each kept line's position and its
stage-symmetric images (at that line's length), reaches every position within the stage worst above.  A
position's solving sequence is the actions along its path, then the kept line it reaches.
Made by devtools/colconcise (logs: certruns/concise); expanded by certsolve (certrest.h ColStage::build).

